│ practitioner in primary care for adult patients with urinary incontinence: the PromoCon study (Promoting             │
│ Continence)", "abstract": "BACKGROUND Urinary incontinence affects approximately 5% (800.000) of the Dutch           │
│ population. Guidelines recommend pelvic floor muscle/bladder training for most patients. Unfortunately, general      │
│ practitioners use this training only incidentally, but prescribe incontinence pads. Over 50% of patients get such    │
