  "title": "Effect of electromyographic biofeedback as an add‐on to pelvic floor muscle exercises on neuromuscular      
  outcomes and quality of life in postmenopausal women with stress urinary incontinence: a randomized controlled        
  trial", "abstract": "AIMS To compare the efficacy of pelvic floor muscle exercises (PFME) with and without            
